WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:17.480
"Yikes!" thought Tom.

2
00:00:17.481 --> 00:00:19.972
Crocodiles filled the moat.

3
00:00:19.973 --> 00:00:22.807
Some of the crocodiles were sleeping.

4
00:00:22.808 --> 00:00:26.439
Others were swimming in the water.

5
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:29.873
Dirk clapped Tom hard on the shoulder.

6
00:00:29.874 --> 00:00:33.764
"Ack!" Tom cried.

7
00:00:33.765 --> 00:00:36.341
He started to fall toward the water.

8
00:00:36.342 --> 00:00:45.353
Dirk grabbed Tom's robe just in time.

9
00:00:45.354 --> 00:00:51.668
"Your silly net spell didn't work," Dirk said.

10
00:00:51.669 --> 00:00:57.031
"You better think of something else fast!"

11
00:00:57.032 --> 00:01:02.361
Tom gulped. "No problem!" he said.

12
00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.765
"I'll think of another spell!"

13
00:01:04.766 --> 00:01:13.091
Princess Mary started to cry again.

14
00:01:13.092 --> 00:01:15.191
"My royal crown!

15
00:01:15.192 --> 00:01:18.838
It's lost forever!"

16
00:01:18.839 --> 00:01:22.847
Tom wrung his hands.

17
00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:32.553
"What am I going to do?" he thought.

18
00:01:32.554 --> 00:01:36.596
Finally Tom just lifted his wand again.

19
00:01:36.597 --> 00:01:40.152
"Crown that is down!" he yelled.

20
00:01:40.153 --> 00:01:42.725
"Land in my hand!"

21
00:01:42.726 --> 00:01:45.144
Tom held out one hand.

22
00:01:45.145 --> 00:01:49.443
He stared hopefully into the dark water.

23
00:01:49.444 --> 00:01:52.011
"Whoa!" he cried.

24
00:01:52.012 --> 00:01:58.624
Everyone clapped as the crown started to rise.

25
00:01:58.625 --> 00:02:03.933
"Wow! Tom did it!" whispered a servant.

26
00:02:03.934 --> 00:02:07.672
"Hmpf!" Dirk said with a scowl.

27
00:02:07.673 --> 00:02:11.167
Princess Mary wiped away her tears.

28
00:02:11.168 --> 00:02:15.171
"Just one more second, everybody!" Tom called.

29
00:02:15.172 --> 00:02:18.197
He kept his hand over the moat.

30
00:02:18.198 --> 00:02:20.911
"Then I'll have the crown!"

31
00:02:20.912 --> 00:02:26.432
Suddenly Tom saw something else.

32
00:02:26.433 --> 00:02:31.399
"You idiot!" Dirk yelled.

33
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.903
"Oops," Tom whispered.

34
00:02:34.904 --> 00:02:38.000
"Here comes the crown . . .

35
00:02:38.001 --> 00:02:47.127
On top of a hungry crocodile!"
